# The image copies ONLY the prebuilt native binary and the mkfifo sources, so
# send nothing else as the build context — this keeps the buildx upload tiny
# and keeps the .git dir, the event store, and tik's sources out of the image
# build entirely.
*
!target/tik
!container/mkfifo/
